---
title: Meeting-day runbook — election count only, other business under ordinary procedure
---
flowchart TD
    R["Zoom registration closes<br/>30 min before start"] --> W{"Waiting room:<br/>registrant email matches<br/>lot's registered address?"}
    W -- Yes --> AD["Admit"]
    W -- No --> CR["Challenge–response to registered<br/>address / voice check of held details"]
    CR -- Verified --> AD
    CR -- Unresolved --> OB["Admit as OBSERVER<br/>(upgradeable mid-meeting<br/>if verification completes)"]
    AD --> RN["Host renames participant:<br/>'Lot 304 – A. Carson (Owner)' /<br/>'Lots C9,C37 – J. Chin (Proxy)'"]
    RN --> Q["Quorum computed live (s 77):<br/>lots represented, else entitlements ·<br/>chair states s 78 consequences if short"]
    Q --> OTH["Other AGM business —<br/>chair's ordinary procedure<br/>(outside this system)"]
    OTH --> REG["Proxy register (and pre-vote register,<br/>if any) screen-shared BEFORE<br/>the election"]
    REG --> NOM["Oral nominations checked live<br/>(ownership · arrears · one-per-lot)"]
    NOM --> EL["ELECTION COUNT (~25 min):<br/>candidate list read → 5-min chat<br/>ballot window (up to 7 candidates<br/>per lot) → reconciliation →<br/>every candidate's total announced"]
    EL --> TIE{"7th seat tied?"}
    TIE -- Yes --> RO2["Runoff between tied candidates ·<br/>if still tied, random draw<br/>on camera (method announced<br/>before the window opened)"]
    TIE -- No --> SV
    RO2 --> SV["ON CAMERA: save workbook twice —<br/>FORMULAS copy + values-frozen<br/>FINAL snapshot"]
    SV --> SEND["Still screen-sharing: email composed —<br/>both files attached · BCC every registered<br/>owner email · CC scrutineers —<br/>SEND clicked in view of the meeting"]
    SEND --> EN["Each scrutineer endorses in chat:<br/>'workbook as sent reflects<br/>the tally displayed'"]
    EN --> CL["Chair closes meeting ·<br/>chat log saved · recording retained"]
    CL --> P48["+48h: provisional ballots resolved by<br/>supplementary email (only where they<br/>could change who is elected) — the<br/>dispatched workbook is never reissued"]
    P48 --> MIN["+14 days: minutes + annexed registers,<br/>chat log and results to all owners"]
